{{see|Equus}}
==Latin==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[equos]] ''(till the middle of the first century B.C.)''
* [[ecus]] ''(the regular development, later remodeled to ''equus'' on the analogy of the stem ''equ-'' as remained, e.g., in the genitive'' equi.)

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Indo-European|h₁éḱwos|horse|lang=la}}. Cognates include Ancient  Greek {{term|ἵππος|tr=hippos|sc=polytonic|lang=grc}} and Sanskrit {{term|अश्व|tr=áśva|sc=Deva|lang=sa}}.

